$ Python library: curl_cffi
@ curl_cffi

*curl_cffi* is a Python binding for → tools/cURL[curl].

Unlike other (pure python) libraries like → development/languages/Python/libraries/HTTPX or → development/languages/Python/libraries/requests, curl_cffi can impersonate browsers' TLS/JA3 and HTTP/2 fingerprints (and might therefore be helpful when being blocked by a webserver).
